{"title":"Quality Analyst Roadmap","role":"Quality Analyst","summary":"A Quality Analyst in the cosmetics and personal-care industry evaluates raw materials, packaging components, in-process materials, and finished cosmetic products to ensure they meet established quality, safety, stability, and specification requirements.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Pharm (Bachelor of Pharmacy)","Course":"Cosmetic Science / Cosmetology"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Quality Analyst in the cosmetics and personal-care industry evaluates raw materials, packaging components, in-process materials, and finished cosmetic products to ensure they meet established quality, safety, stability, and specification requirements."},{"type":"p","text":"A B.Pharm graduate with a Cosmetic Science/Cosmetology orientation can build a strong profile across:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cosmetic formulation"},{"text":"Pharmaceutical and cosmetic chemistry"},{"text":"Quality control"},{"text":"Quality assurance"},{"text":"Microbiological quality"},{"text":"Stability testing"},{"text":"Raw-material testing"},{"text":"Packaging evaluation"},{"text":"Regulatory compliance"},{"text":"Laboratory documentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest positioning is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Cosmetic Science","Pharmaceutical Analysis","Quality Control","GMP","Cosmetic Regulations"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2028"},{"text":"Entry Level"},{"text":"QC Analyst / Quality Analyst / Laboratory Trainee"}],[{"text":"2028–2030"},{"text":"Early Career"},{"text":"QC Executive / Cosmetic Quality Analyst"}],[{"text":"2030–2034"},{"text":"Mid Career"},{"text":"Senior QC Analyst / QA Executive"}],[{"text":"2034–2038"},{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"Quality Manager / QA Manager"}],[{"text":"2038–2043"