ne"},{"text":"Aseptic practices where applicable"},{"text":"Microbial testing"},{"text":"Preservation effectiveness concepts"},{"text":"Contamination investigation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is particularly important for products containing water or other conditions favorable to microbial growth."}]},{"heading":"Quality Assurance Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"h","text":"GMP"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Good Manufacturing Practices"},{"text":"Personnel hygiene"},{"text":"Facility controls"},{"text":"Equipment qualification concepts"},{"text":"Cleaning"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Material control"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Quality Systems"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SOPs"},{"text":"Specifications"},{"text":"Batch records"},{"text":"Deviations"},{"text":"OOS investigations"},{"text":"CAPA"},{"text":"Change control"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"Audit preparation"}]}]},{"heading":"Regulatory Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A cosmetic Quality Analyst should understand the regulatory framework applicable to the markets in which the company operates."},{"type":"h","text":"India"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop awareness of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cosmetics-related provisions under Indian law"},{"text":"Applicable CDSCO requirements"},{"text":"Cosmetics Rules and standards"},{"text":"Product labeling"},{"text":"Ingredient restrictions"},{"text":"Quality and safety requirements"},{"text":"Manufacturing documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"International Exposure"},{"type":"p","text":"For global companies, learn the basic structure of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EU cosmetics requirements"},{"text":"US cosmetic regulatory framework"},{"text":"ASEAN cosmetic framework"},{"text":"International quality standards"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Specific regulatory requirements depend on the product, claims, ingredients, market and company operations, so curre